# Runtime patient data. This directory holds captured photos, recorded task
# video, and landmark sequences stored under the patient's 7-digit hospital
# registration number -- identifiable clinical data that must never enter git
# history, public or private. The whole directory is excluded rather than
# individual file patterns, so a new artifact type added under backend/data/
# later (as task-data/ was) is covered by default instead of silently becoming
# committable.
backend/data/

